config BR2_PACKAGE_KNPU_MODELS
	bool "knpu-models"
	help
	  The test models of the kn1-npu compiled to model.knpu, with
	  their inputs and expected outputs, from models/ of this
	  repository: the convolution test model in
	  /usr/share/knpu/conv/, and the MNIST CNN with the MNIST
	  digit images in /usr/share/knpu/mnist/. V6 runs them with
	  knpu-infer.
